# Prettier scope: the code — src/, scripts/, test/ and the root configs. The
# npm scripts (format / format:check) pass the scope explicitly; this file
# additionally keeps editor integrations and a manual `prettier --check .`
# on the same scope.

# Build and state output
dist/
coverage/

# Local-only trees (never shipped)
.worktrees/
spikes/

# Historical documents — ADRs are immutable once accepted (AGENTS.md §12),
# and plans/research notes are committed history, not prose to reflow
docs/
.github/
.githooks/

# Markdown and machine-generated data are not formatted code
*.md
package-lock.json
